{title: Holy Holy Holy}
{key: F}
{x_theme: praise}
{x_source: chrd:holy_holy_holy.chrd}

{comment: Verse}
[C]Holy, Holy, [F]Ho - [C]ly.  [C]Holy, Holy, [F]Ho - [C]ly
[C]Holy [Em]is    [F]the  [C]Lord, [F]God  [C]Al - [G]migh - [G7]ty
[C]Worthy to receive [F]glo - [C]ry. Worthy to receive [F]ho - [C]nour
Worthy [Em]to    [F]re - [C]ceive [F]all  [C]our  [G7]praise [C]today

{comment: Chorus}
[Bb]Praise [F]Him, [Bb]praise Him [F]and lift Him [C]up
[Bb]Praise [F]Him, e[Bb]xalt His [F]name for[C]ever
{ci: (repeat)}
